his also includes allies.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195501\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.094 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.112 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4399/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 41059/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 17239/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.033/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 968226/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   99.944      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   99.944      1 -total\n 42.76%   42.740      7 Template:Cond\n 28.23%   28.219     14 Template:Icon_text\n 28.03%   28.011     13 Template:Icon_link\n 23.73%   23.713     34 Template:Trim\n 21.05%   21.039      8 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 18.99%   18.975      4 Template:SmArea\n 13.87%   13.859     16 Template:Ifempty\n 12.96%   12.954      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28432-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195501 and revision id 391389. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}